{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/css/grid/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"css-grid-layout\" style=\"position:relative;\">CSS Grid Layout<a href=\"#css-grid-layout\" aria-label=\"css grid layout permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>CSS 그리드 레이아웃은 페이지를 여러 주요 영역으로 나누거나, 크기와 위치 및 문서 계층 구조의 관점에서 HTML 기본 요소로 작성된 콘트롤 간의 관계를 정의하는데 아주 탁월하다.</p>\n<p><strong>테이블</strong>과 마찬가지로 그리드 레이아웃은 세로 열과 가로 행을 기준으로 요소를 정렬할 수 있다. 하지만, 테이블과 달리 CSS 그리드는 다양한 레이아웃을 훨씬 더 쉽게 구현할 수 있다.<br>\n예를 들어, 그리드 컨테이너 속 자식 요소를, 마치 CSS로 일일이 위치를 지정해 준 것처럼, 실제로 겹치게 층을 지면서 자리를 잡도록 각 요소의 위치를 지정해줄 수도 있다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"그리드-사용하기\" style=\"position:relative;\">그리드 사용하기<a href=\"#%EA%B7%B8%EB%A6%AC%EB%93%9C-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"그리드 사용하기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"display-grid\" style=\"position:relative;\">display: grid<a href=\"#display-grid\" aria-label=\"display grid permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>그리드 컨테이너는 요소에 <code class=\"language-text\">display: grid</code> 또는 <code class=\"language-text\">display: inline-grid</code>를 선언하여 사용한다.<br>\n이렇게 하면 요소 바로 밑에 있는 모든 자식 요소는 grid Items이 된다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-css line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token selector\">.wrap</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">display</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> grid<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"grid-template-\" style=\"position:relative;\">grid-template-<a href=\"#grid-template-\" aria-label=\"grid template  permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>그리드에는 특이하게도 테이블처럼 행과 열 (column, row) 개념이 존재한다.</p>\n<p>column은 세로, row는 가로축을 의미하며<br>\n그리드 시스템에선 이 column과 row를 트랙(Track)이라고 부른다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" width=\"650\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/6ee8baa7d156cc86d924f95766a4ebb4/2324c/grid-01.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 65.625%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/6ee8baa7d156cc86d924f95766a4ebb4/a59e9/grid-01.webp 192w,\n/static/6ee8baa7d156cc86d924f95766a4ebb4/0ca9f/grid-01.webp 384w,\n/static/6ee8baa7d156cc86d924f95766a4ebb4/dc9b9/grid-01.webp 768w,\n/static/6ee8baa7d156cc86d924f95766a4ebb4/e2c2f/grid-01.webp 1152w,\n/static/6ee8baa7d156cc86d924f95766a4ebb4/7cd0c/grid-01.webp 1229w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/6ee8baa7d156cc86d924f95766a4ebb4/3b721/grid-01.png 192w,\n/static/6ee8baa7d156cc86d924f95766a4ebb4/66595/grid-01.png 384w,\n/static/6ee8baa7d156cc86d924f95766a4ebb4/fe486/grid-01.png 768w,\n/static/6ee8baa7d156cc86d924f95766a4ebb4/d2d74/grid-01.png 1152w,\n/static/6ee8baa7d156cc86d924f95766a4ebb4/2324c/grid-01.png 1229w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/6ee8baa7d156cc86d924f95766a4ebb4/fe486/grid-01.png\"\n            alt=\"grid template\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span>\r\n<em>3개의 column과 2개의 row</em></p>\n<p>위의 이미지를 코드로 표현하면</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-css line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token selector\">.wrap</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">display</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> grid<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">grid-template-columns</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 150px 150px 150px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">grid-template-row</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 150px 150px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>각 라인에 이름을 지어줄 수도 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-css line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token selector\">.wrap</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">display</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> grid<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">grid-template-columns</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> [first] 100px [second] 200px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"repeat-함수와-fr-단위\" style=\"position:relative;\">repeat() 함수와 fr 단위<a href=\"#repeat-%ED%95%A8%EC%88%98%EC%99%80-fr-%EB%8B%A8%EC%9C%84\" aria-label=\"repeat 함수와 fr 단위 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>트랙의 값을 repeat 함수와 fr단위를 사용해 표현할 수 있다.</p>\n<p>아래 예제는 20px 사이즈의 item 1개 뒤로 1fr, 2fr사이즈의 item 2개가 5회 반복되고 마지막으로 20px사이즈의 item이 위치하게 된다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-css line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token selector\">.wrap</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">display</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> grid<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">grid-template-columns</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 20px <span class=\"token function\">repeat</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>5<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> 1fr<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> 2fr<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> 20px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"minmax-함수\" style=\"position:relative;\">minmax() 함수<a href=\"#minmax-%ED%95%A8%EC%88%98\" aria-label=\"minmax 함수 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<p>grid item의 최소 높이값을 100px, 최대 높이값을 가장 높은 셀의 크기만큼 자동으로 늘어나게 해준다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-css line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token selector\">.wrap</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">display</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> grid<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">grid-auto-rows</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token function\">minmax</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>100px<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> auto<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"auto-fill\" style=\"position:relative;\">auto-fill<a href=\"#auto-fill\" aria-label=\"auto fill permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<p>column, row의 개수를 컨테이너에 맞게 자동적으로 조절해준다. 따라서 쉽게 반응형을 만들 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-css line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token selector\">.wrap</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">display</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> grid<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">grid-template-columns</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token function\">repeat</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>auto-fill<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token function\">minmax</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>150px<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> 1fr<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<br>\r\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"그리드-내-아이템-배치하기\" style=\"position:relative;\">그리드 내 아이템 배치하기<a href=\"#%EA%B7%B8%EB%A6%AC%EB%93%9C-%EB%82%B4-%EC%95%84%EC%9D%B4%ED%85%9C-%EB%B0%B0%EC%B9%98%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"그리드 내 아이템 배치하기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"grid-line\" style=\"position:relative;\">grid-line<a href=\"#grid-line\" aria-label=\"grid line permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>그리드는 아이템을 배치할 때 쓸 수 있게 번호가 매겨진 라인을 자동으로 제공한다.</p>\n<p>아래 그림처럼, 그리드가 세 개의 세로 열(Column)과 두 개의 가로 행(Row)으로 이루어져 있다면, 네 개의 Grid Line이 Column으로 자리 잡게 된다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" width=\"650\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 764px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/4c3fb3b91efd0df49cfe4ff9eff8a834/2cbcd/grid-02.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 59.895833333333336%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/4c3fb3b91efd0df49cfe4ff9eff8a834/a59e9/grid-02.webp 192w,\n/static/4c3fb3b91efd0df49cfe4ff9eff8a834/0ca9f/grid-02.webp 384w,\n/static/4c3fb3b91efd0df49cfe4ff9eff8a834/83502/grid-02.webp 764w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 764px) 100vw, 764px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/4c3fb3b91efd0df49cfe4ff9eff8a834/3b721/grid-02.png 192w,\n/static/4c3fb3b91efd0df49cfe4ff9eff8a834/66595/grid-02.png 384w,\n/static/4c3fb3b91efd0df49cfe4ff9eff8a834/2cbcd/grid-02.png 764w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 764px) 100vw, 764px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/4c3fb3b91efd0df49cfe4ff9eff8a834/2cbcd/grid-02.png\"\n            alt=\"grid-line\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>아래 예제는 grid item에 <code class=\"language-text\">grid-column-start</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">grid-column-end</code>를 사용하여 레이아웃을 잡았다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-css line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token selector\">.wrap</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">display</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> grid<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">grid-template-columns</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 150px 150px 150px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">grid-template-rows</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 150px 150px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token selector\">.wrap .box1</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">grid-column-start</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 1<span class=\"token punctuation\">;